SUMMARY:Jason Whitaker at the Hilton Garden Inn South!
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\n# Start your weekend with melodic tunes
  at the Garden Inn South\, featuring Jason Whitaker\n\nATTENDEE LIMIT HAS 
 BEEN INCREASED TO ACCOMODATE MORE.\n\nEnjoy your friends and the food and 
 drinks from the Garden Grille & Bar while listening to Jason Whitaker (He 
 plays from 6pm - 9pm).\n\nJason is an expressive multi decade Light Rock g
 uitarist and balladeer (think: Eagles\, Clapton\, Seger\, James Taylor\, J
 im Croce\, Mellencamp\, Fleetwood Mac\, Bon Jovi\, even a little Elvis). C
 ome unwind with us at the relaxing and comfortable garden setting for a mu
 sical evening at the Hilton by the Asheville Outlets.\n\nThere is free par
 king in both the front of the hotel and behind it as well.\nCarpooling is 
 encouraged.\n\nThe Hilton is right near the Asheville Tanger Outlet Mall. 
 Take Exit 33 (Brevard Road) off Highway 26. Parking is free!\n\nThe music 
 is free! Please show your appreciation by tipping.\n\n**Hilton Garden Inn 
 Asheville South**\n9 Rocky Ridge Rd\nAsheville\, NC 28806\nPhone: (828) 63
 3-6024
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillesocial/events/315193295/
